__pycache__/
docs/_build/*
docs/_autosummary/*

.DS_STORE

# editor / agent tooling state (never part of the package)
.claude/

# local docs build environment
.venv-docs/

# build artifacts
*.egg-info/
build/
dist/
*.so
# Cython-generated C source (regenerated at build time)
rainbow/agilent/_uvdelta.c
rainbow/agilent/_msprofile.c
rainbow/agilent/_chdelta.c

# working notes, not part of the package
/asm-notes/
/asm-reference/

# Local datasets and anything derived from them. Keep them here rather than
# adding a new entry per dataset: a per-dataset line is a poor guard, since it
# protects only what someone remembered to list, and the entry outlives the
# data.
/data/
/datasets/
# exported ASM documents (never commit; these come from real samples)
/ASMs/

# Every directory at the repository root is ignored unless it is named below,
# so a dataset dropped there is covered whatever it is called, rather than only
# if somebody remembered to list it. Most vendor data is a directory (a .D, a
# .raw, a folder of them), but not all of it: a .dx is a single file, and
# rainbow's per-file parsers read a lone .ch, .uv, .ms, or Waters .dat. Those
# extensions are matched too, case-insensitively, because a vendor writes
# DAD1A.CH as readily as .ch and git only folds case where core.ignorecase is
# set, which it is not on Linux CI.
#
# Root *files* are otherwise left visible, deliberately. Ignoring all of them
# would mean a new CONTRIBUTING.md or .pre-commit-config.yaml never appears in
# `git status` and is never picked up by `git add -A`, which is a quiet way to
# lose work. (Being ignored is not what protects a file from `git clean -fdx`:
# that removes untracked root files either way. If anything, ignoring one
# protects it from a plain `git clean -fd`.)
#
# The cost that remains: a genuinely new project *directory* at the root is
# ignored, so add it here when you add it. Everything inside the directories
# below behaves normally.
/*/
/*.[dD][xX]
/*.[zZ][iI][pP]
/*.[jJ][sS][oO][nN]
/*.[cC][hH]
/*.[uU][vV]
/*.[mM][sS]
/*.[dD][aA][tT]
!/.github/
!/docs/
!/rainbow/
!/scripts/
!/tests/
